        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1118/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9385655013556fe8209ffc8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在设施里，也有不管是谁都用糖果\r\n和恶作剧来让人做选择的孩子……\r\n……所以我随身带着。糖果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c920631ed5fd45bced8d84f8aa52dd2e3964324ccc8089a79c8dcb4c151b6d71",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
